    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Late-Night Show Turns Into a Hunt for the Truth. You finally landed your first real gig\u2014a late-night radio show in a small backwater town. It\u2019s supposed to be your big break, but when strange cosmic events begin to unfold, your routine broadcast quickly becomes a battle for survival.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Social Deduction Meets Survival Horror</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/bf1c62810b08a3ef8df0f78353fa6195.poster.avif?t=1747320493\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/bf1c62810b08a3ef8df0f78353fa6195.webm?t=1747320493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/bf1c62810b08a3ef8df0f78353fa6195.mp4?t=1747320493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <br><strong>\u00a0</strong>Your only connection to the outside world is your callers\u2014but can you trust them?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully. Some want to help, others want to lead you astray.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher their motives. Are they real fans or something far more sinister?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the night. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/a4ed6c350524c852ffaab51c615f69dd.poster.avif?t=1747320493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/a4ed6c350524c852ffaab51c615f69dd.webm?t=1747320493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/a4ed6c350524c852ffaab51c615f69dd.mp4?t=1747320493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep the Show Running \u2013 No Matter What</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It\u2019s just you, your phone lines, and your studio equipment\u2014but something else is out there.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your broadcast. Keep the music flowing and the signal alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off unseen horrors. Strange entities lurk in the darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mystery. The truth is hidden between the static.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you keep the airwaves alive, or will the night consume you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/a793e7b325f6bb1dd753f1c8c2545a65.poster.avif?t=1747320493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/a793e7b325f6bb1dd753f1c8c2545a65.webm?t=1747320493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574700/extras/a793e7b325f6bb1dd753f1c8c2545a65.mp4?t=1747320493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
